    description: Some("Knights ride armoured buzzards over floating ledges, and a joust is settled by whoever sits higher at the moment of contact. Unseated riders drop as eggs to be collected before they hatch into something tougher, while lava pits open up after the second wave and a pterodactyl has to be struck squarely on the beak."),
